## AI tooling

Cursor rules in `.cursor/rules/` and hooks in `.cursor/hooks/` mirror the setup from
`password.manager`, adapted for this single-app frontend repo. Quality gates are
defined in `.cursor/rules/quality-gating.mdc`.

